Band Description: A revolving trio of aging astrophysicists and stowaway percussionists. They perform seated on the floor, barefoot, treating the piano as a living creature that needs coaxing rather than playing. Their aesthetic is "brutalist cozy"—heavy industrial materials paired with knitted, threadbare blankets.

